          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Fibre cement facing tile, at plant
Swiss consumption mix;
UUID: aade61ac-44c0-3c4b-8f44-449a3debda1c
Establishes a mix of small and large fibre cement facing tiles produced by Eternit Switzerland according to the Swiss consumption mix.
Location: Production in Switzerland for World wide market
Technology: Raw tile production, drying, coating
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
